    assert len(failed)>=2
    who=('Codex authored nested dispatcher status6 propagation, loader-frame resume driving and scheduler/device-event integration. Original CPU/GPU validates all16disc cases including full CPU/RAM/private frames,32loading switches and independently matched payloads. Original CPU and independent Unicorn validate the1890case dispatcher regression; the25case scheduler regression also passed. The local27Bbase answered five SDK prompts, including Analyst/Reviewer roles on the same weights. No local-model-authored code, new training, weight download, model switch or weight-default promotion occurred. A general concise-prompt experiment was rejected after two incorrect loading explanations; the previous canonical prompt was restored and native preset files were not changed. Native Chat generation/adoption remains unverified after the prior UI timeout; no new UI attempt or unlock request in this checkpoint.')
    corrections=[
        'Actual loaderDF60 suspension now propagates through nested loader/acquisition/input/world CPU frames. Source resumes1B0DA and nested RTS continuations. Completion bytes/progress arrive only after a real handoff away from world; no fakeDF60RTS remains. BIOS303C/3042 and supplied file completion events remain controlled boundaries.',
        'Historical assisted-startup SSP1D0000 overlapped theCDwindow. First mismatch was at1CFFFA, exactly SSP-6, the exceptionframe address. Corrected suppliedSSP to1FF000, reserve4KB, enforce all32transfers below1FE000. No game C behavior was repaired; actual boot stack placement/physicaltiming remains unproved. Total changed-byte count was not measured.',
        'All16cases pass720completedworldupdates/2048actoriterations/272equipment+32loader suspensions/5136handoffs. Earlier adapter-only run had752worldupdates; additional loader waits let other tasks run. This is not a speed regression claim.32payloads/3080416bytes/threeunique payloads remain independently matched.',
        'Input fullCPU regression1890cases/all816instructions/38guards and25scheduler regression cases passed with new source hashes. Component count108unchanged. SynchronizationDF8C/DF9C and11otherdispatcher services are unsupported/unreached.16contexts includingrender remain blocked; livequeueconsumer/scenes/remainingtasks/audio/fullgame unfinished.',
        'Baseline216word ordinary answer is factually correct but too technical;107word same-model role answer is bounded correct. Concise ordinary reply invented one-byte corruption; after evidence clarified first-address versus count, retry reversed causality. Both rejected. Separate54word playability answer passed. General brevity/style improvement not established; default restored. Exact trials retained.',
        'Mapped21sourceinstructions forDF04/DF8C/DF9C/DEF6 synchronization and TRAP4vector0x90→DEF6. Mapping is preparation only; no synchronization port/execution claim. Next fixture should exercise real readiness wait/wake across two resource callers.'
    ]
